/ A where value given as a %variable% that holds nothing fails as reading it fails anywhere: VariableNotFound,
/ read where the query runs.
Start
- variable.set(Name=%users%, Value=[{name: "a", age: 30}, {name: "b", age: 10}])
- list.query(List=%users%, Query={where: {field: "age", op: ">", value: %limit%}}); on.error(Key="VariableNotFound", Recovery=[goal.call(Name="Caught")]); variable.set(Name=%old%, Value=%!data%)
- assert.contains(Value="limit", Container=%caught%, Message="the error names the variable")

Caught
- variable.set(Name=%caught%, Value=%!error.Message%)
